Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.20,0:00:28.50,CtaTop,,0,0,0,,FOOTWEAR FACTORY IN CHINA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.20,0:00:28.50,CtaMid,,0,0,0,,SAMPLES  •  COLOR DISCUSSION  •  WHOLESALE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:01.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,One grey knit upper.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.62,0:00:03.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,Three sole colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.22,0:00:05.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,Which would your customers choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.09,0:00:07.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,Grey-white looks clean and versatile.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.35,0:00:10.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,Grey-black feels practical for everyday wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.12,0:00:12.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Grey-khaki brings a warmer outdoor mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:15.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,Beyond color, the shoe keeps
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.45,0:00:17.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,a roomy rounded front,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.75,0:00:20.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,a knitted slip-on upper and heel pull tab,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.50,0:00:22.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,with a textured cushioned sole.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.18,0:00:24.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,Which color fits your market?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.20,0:00:26.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,We’re a footwear factory in China.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:28.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,Message us for samples and wholesale details.
